      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.19,
      "end_seconds": 42.64,
      "duration_seconds": 10.45,
      "text": "Itching goes along with it, most of the time. Yeah, the Itching? That's been for three days. With Itching, severe, I'd say."
